Divex works magic and carries bombs, and travels with [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]], [[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]] and [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]] as [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. He can hide the company from sight, and keeps what he carries in his shadow: the [[Phenomena/Althane/Godpiercer|godpiercer]], and a great store of small wind-up watches. When the others find something enchanted, he is the one who says what it is.

He was born in the blood lake of [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Fat Cock City|Fat Cock City]] and swam in it as a child. He was framed, long before the Weft's work, for stealing a set of costly artifacts; the thief was [[People/Althane/The Broker|Tech]], who handed the goods to [[People/Althane/Rowan|Rowan]] and never collected them. Divex did not know who had taken them until he learned that the Broker was Tech.

He carries the chrome of [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)|Syrin]] in his skull and neck.
